{"id":"5410a5b39300442c","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-lem-henkin.md","title":"Henkin Extension Lemma","display":"lem-henkin — Henkin Extension Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-henkin","aliases":["58-lem-henkin"],"display":"lem-henkin — Henkin Extension Lemma","depends_on":["[[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-henkin"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-henkin</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-henkin — Henkin Extension Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"303ea9f3c70914f9\" href=\"?note=303ea9f3c70914f9\" title=\"58-df-language-with-constants.md\">58-df-language-with-constants.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6996aaff4caeacce\" href=\"?note=6996aaff4caeacce\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md\">../batch13/58-df-consistency.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"90ce6acf0c65af45\" href=\"?note=90ce6acf0c65af45\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-theory.md\">../batch08/58-df-theory.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"60d957ce43061cb6\" href=\"?note=60d957ce43061cb6\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md\">../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma,\\Gamma^*,L,L^H,B,c\\in V\">\\(\\Gamma,\\Gamma^*,L,L^H,B,c\\in V\\)</span> and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L^H):\\operatorname{FV}_{L^H}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\}\">\\(B=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L^H):\\operatorname{FV}_{L^H}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L^H,L,B,c)\">\\(\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L^H,L,B,c)\\)</span> supplies a fresh constant term <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(\\varphi)\">\\(c(\\varphi)\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in B\">\\(\\varphi\\in B\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SubFml}\">\\(\\mathrm{SubFml}\\)</span> are the exact predicates and operations from the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HenkinCompletion}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{HenkinCompletion}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> is defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}completion}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HenkinCompletion}_S(\\Gamma^*,\\Gamma,L,L^H,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nB=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L^H):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L^H}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L^H,L,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Gamma^*\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma^*,L^H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\Gamma^*)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Delta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma^*\\subsetneq\\Delta\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Delta,L^H)\n\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\Delta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\bigl((\\exists v_0\\,\\varphi)\\to\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_{L^H}(\\varphi,c(\\varphi),v_0)\\bigr)\\in\\Gamma^*\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}henkin\\text{-}completion}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HenkinCompletion}_S(\\Gamma^*,\\Gamma,L,L^H,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nB=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L^H):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L^H}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L^H,L,B,c)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\n\\land\\Gamma\\subseteq\\Gamma^*\n\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma^*,L^H)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\Gamma^*)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\Delta\\in V\\;\n\\bigl(\\Gamma^*\\subsetneq\\Delta\\land\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Delta,L^H)\n\\to\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\Delta)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in B\\;\n\\Bigl(\\bigl((\\exists v_0\\,\\varphi)\\to\n\\mathrm{SubFml}_{L^H}(\\varphi,c(\\varphi),v_0)\\bigr)\\in\\Gamma^*\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}henkin}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\Gamma)\n\\land B=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L^H):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L^H}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L^H,L,B,c)\n\\to\\exists\\Gamma^*\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinCompletion}_S(\\Gamma^*,\\Gamma,L,L^H,B,c).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}henkin}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Theory}(\\Gamma,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_S(\\Gamma)\n\\land B=\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L^H):\n\\operatorname{FV}_{L^H}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_0\\}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L^H,L,B,c)\n\\to\\exists\\Gamma^*\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{HenkinCompletion}_S(\\Gamma^*,\\Gamma,L,L^H,B,c).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The expansion and its injection of formula-indexed fresh constants are explicit antecedent data; the lemma no longer quantifies over informal expressions <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi(x)\">\\(\\varphi(x)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Maximality is expressed as absence of a proper consistent theory extension, rather than by an undeclared <code>MaximallyConsistent</code> predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-language-with-constants.md","status":"resolved","id":"303ea9f3c70914f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-consistency.md","status":"resolved","id":"6996aaff4caeacce","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-consistency.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"90ce6acf0c65af45","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"60d957ce43061cb6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-substitution-formula.md]]","